  "notes": "<p>Ilvena Dur-Pekk, a clerk in the Kragmir mine office under Fundin Dur-Krept. She logs and stores pass-rune blanks before they are activated, and she cannot activate one herself. She loses more at the dice club Шестая Грань in a week than she earns, and the 450 gp die in her hand was bought on credit. Blanks go missing on her shift, and she has already sold one to the fixer they call Гвоздь. She has never been in a fight, and it shows.</p>",
